  "subject": "多元数理科学研究科_全专攻",
  "text": "讨论向量组 $v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\ v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\t\\\\t\\end{pmatrix},\\ v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$（$t$为实数）是否构成 $\\mathbb{R}^3$ 的基。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "行列式判定线性无关",
    "基的定义",
    "参数依赖的可逆性讨论"
  ],
  "question_type": "基的判定",
  "method": [
    "计算三阶行列式作为t的函数",
    "求使行列式为零的临界值"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "以 $v_1,v_2,v_3$ 为列构造矩阵 $M$，计算 $\\det M$ 关于 $t$ 的表达式",
    "求解 $\\det M=0$ 的 $t$ 值，确定退化情形",
    "结论：当 $\\det M\\ne0$ 时三向量构成基"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "basis_determinant_criterion",
    "template": "\\det[v_1|v_2|v_3]=f(t)",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "结论",
      "steps": [
        "构造矩阵 $M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\\\2&t&1\\\\1&t&1\\end{pmatrix}$，按第一行展开：$\\det M=1\\cdot(t\\cdot1-1\\cdot t)-2\\cdot(2\\cdot1-1\\cdot1)+3\\cdot(2t-t\\cdot1)$",
        "化简各项：第一项 $=t-t=0$；第二项 $=-2\\cdot1=-2$；第三项 $=3t$，故 $\\det M=0-2+3t=3t-2$",
        "令 $3t-2=0$ 得临界值 $t=2/3$；当 $t\\ne 2/3$ 时 $\\det M\\ne0$，三向量线性无关，构成 $\\mathbb{R}^3$ 的基；当 $t=2/3$ 时 $\\det M=0$，三向量线性相关，不构成基",
        "验证：取 $t=0$ 代入原式得 $\\det M=3(0)-2=-2\\ne0$，直接计算矩阵$\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&3\\\\2&0&1\\\\1&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$的行列式：$1(0-0)-2(2-1)+3(0-0)=-2$，一致，验证正确"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "判断向量 $u_1=(1,0,1)^T, u_2=(0,1,1)^T, u_3=(1,1,s)^T$ 是否构成 $\\mathbb{R}^3$ 的基，其中 $s$ 为实数。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "行列式判定基",
        "参数讨论"
      ],
      "question_type": "基的判定",
      "method": [
        "计算行列式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "构造矩阵求行列式",
        "求临界s值"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "basis_determinant_criterion",
        "template": "\\det[u_1|u_2|u_3]=g(s)",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1\\\\0&1&1\\\\1&1&s\\end{pmatrix}=1(s-1)-0+1(0-1)=s-1-1=s-2$",
            "当$s\\ne2$时构成基，当$s=2$时不构成"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2005-89104587cd-q04-practice-01",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2005"
    },
    {
      "text": "求参数 $t$ 使得向量 $(1,t,0)^T,(0,1,t)^T,(t,0,1)^T$ 线性相关。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "行列式",
        "线性相关判定"
      ],
      "question_type": "参数求解",
      "method": [
        "行列式为零求解"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "构造行列式方程",
        "解方程得t"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_dependence_parameter_solving",
        "template": "\\det[w_1|w_2|w_3]=0",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&t\\\\t&1&0\\\\0&t&1\\end{pmatrix}=1(1-0)-0+t(t^2-0)=1+t^3$",
            "令 $1+t^3=0\\Rightarrow t=-1$（实数解）",
            "当 $t=-1$时三向量线性相关"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2005-89104587cd-q04-practice-02",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2005"
    },
