    {
      "text": "设向量 $p_1=(1,1,1)^T,p_2=(1,2,4)^T,p_3=(1,3,t)^T$，求所有使 $\\{p_1,p_2,p_3\\}$ 不构成基的 $t$ 值。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "行列式判定基",
        "范德蒙德型行列式"
      ],
      "question_type": "基的判定",
      "method": [
        "计算行列式并因式分解"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出矩阵求行列式",
        "解方程得临界t"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "basis_determinant_criterion",
        "template": "\\det[p_1|p_2|p_3]=h(t)",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\1&2&3\\\\1&4&t\\end{pmatrix}=1(2t-12)-1(t-3)+1(4-2)=2t-12-t+3+2=t-7$",
            "令 $t-7=0\\Rightarrow t=7$，此时不构成基；$t\\ne7$时构成基"
          ]
        }
      ],
